    "chunk_text": "er Moyses lareowsetl. Healda\u00f0 & wyrcea\u00f0 swa hw\u00e6t swa hig secgea\u00fe & ne do ge na \u00e6fter heora worcum; Hig secgea\u00f0 & ne Hig binda\u00f0 hefige byr\u00feyna \u00fee man aberan ne m\u00e6g & lecgea\u00f0 \u00fea uppan manna exla & nella\u00f0 hig \u00fea Ealle heora worc hig do\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t menn hi geseon; Hig tobr\u00e6da\u00f0 hyra healsb\u00e6c & m\u00e6rsia\u00f0 heora reafa Hig lufigea\u00f0 \u00fea fyrmystan setl on gebeorscypum & \u00fea fyrmystan lareowsetl on gesomnungum. & \u00fe\u00e6t hig man grete on str\u00e6tum & \u00fe\u00e6t menn hig lareowas nemnon. Ne gyrne ge \u00fe\u00e6t eow man lareowas nemne; An ys eower lareow, ge synt ealle gebro\u00feru. & ne nemne ge eow f\u00e6dyr ofer eor\u00fean; An ys eower F\u00e6dyr se \u00fee on heofonum ys. Ne eow man ne nemne lareowas for \u00feam an Crist is eower lareow. Se\u00fee eower yltst sy beo se eower \u00feen. Witodlice se \u00fee hyne uppahef\u00f0 se by\u00fe geny\u00feerud, & se \u00fee hyne sylfne geea\u00f0met se by\u00f0 uppahafyn. Wa eow bocyras & Pharisei, liccetteras, for\u00feam ge beluca\u00f0 heofona rice beforan mannum; Ne ge in Wa eow bocyras & Pharisei, liccetteras, for\u00feam ge befara\u00f0 s\u00e6 & eor\u00fean \u00fe\u00e6t ge don anne el\u00feeodine Wa eow blindan latteowas, ge secgea\u00f0 swa hwylc swa swere\u00fe on temple \u00fe\u00e6t he ys naht, swa hwa Eala ge dysegan & blindan, hw\u00e6",
